      "text": [
        "Shots by the community,for the community",
        "These quirky shots will make you laugh, ponder, and maybe even say, 'Why didn’t I think of that?'",
        "Feb 24, 2025",
        "DittoAI – Taking spam calls so you don’t have to! 📞",
        "Unwanted calls and scams are a daily nuisance for everyone, but what if an AI attends suspicious calls on your behalf, mimicking your voice to engage in the conversation and files a report with authorities if needed!",
        "Feb 12, 2025",
        "Just follow the cues—for picture-perfect shots 📸, every time.",
        "What if your camera gave you real-time prompts like ‘Move closer,’ ‘Adjust the lighting,’ or ‘Fix your pose’? No more endless retakes, tedious edits, or a gallery full of near-identical shots.",
        "Jan 29, 2025",
        "The friendship analytics you never knew you needed 📊 💕",
        "Ever wondered how much time you’ve spent FaceTiming your favorite person? This might help you strike a balance—or realize it’s time to expand your social circle.",
        "Jan 28, 2025",
        "Passive aggressive Zomato 🧑‍🍳",
        "what if Zomato asked you whether you want to cook when you take too much time to decide? It locks you out when you say you want to cook",
        "Jan 27, 2025",
        "For you. Following. Italy? Turkey? Pin your favorite countries",
        "What if switching between trends in different countries was as easy as tapping ‘For You’? Pin your favorites swipe through cultural chaos like a pro."
      ]
